WEBVTT

00:12:58.273 --> 00:13:00.692
Little Brown Bevy is a nerdy girl,

00:13:00.692 --> 00:13:03.070
and so I let my nerdy pursuits
come out to play.

00:13:03.695 --> 00:13:07.366
I must have joined every museum
on Museum Mile in New York City.

00:13:07.574 --> 00:13:09.076
I began to travel the world

00:13:09.076 --> 00:13:11.578
just to look at architecture
I had always dreamed of.

00:13:11.912 --> 00:13:14.331
I learned how to be alone
without being lonely.

00:13:14.915 --> 00:13:16.166
My spirit shifted.

00:13:16.583 --> 00:13:18.252
I became a better person.

00:13:18.418 --> 00:13:19.586
You can ask people --

00:13:19.586 --> 00:13:20.796
I became a better person.

00:13:21.880 --> 00:13:25.175
And now I get to stand here
in front of you guys

00:13:25.175 --> 00:13:26.677
with no bravado,

00:13:26.677 --> 00:13:27.803
with nothing to prove,

00:13:27.803 --> 00:13:29.721
I tell you, with nothing to prove.

00:13:29.721 --> 00:13:31.682
I’m not trying to prove nothing to y’all.